      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "在一张新闻照片里，两人手里拿着倒着的“福”字剪纸微笑。",
      "traditional": "在一張新聞照片裡，兩人手裡拿著倒著的“福”字剪紙微笑。",
      "pinyin": "zài yì zhāng xīn wén zhào piàn lǐ liǎng rén shǒu lǐ ná zhe dào zhe de fú zì jiǎn zhǐ wēi xiào",
      "english": "In the beginning of February, British Prime Minister Theresa May and her husband visited China."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "看到这张照片的英国媒体开始嘲笑他们，说他们不认识汉字，",
      "traditional": "看到這張照片的英國媒體開始嘲笑他們，說他們不認識漢字，",
      "pinyin": "kàn dào zhè zhāng zhào piàn de yīng guó méi tǐ kāi shǐ cháo xiào tā men shuō tā men bú rèn shi hàn zì",
      "english": "In a news photo, they are seen smiling and holding paper cuttings of the character “happiness” turned upside down."
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "把“福”字拿倒了，好运气都用完了。",
      "traditional": "把“福”字拿倒了，好運氣都用完了。",
      "pinyin": "bǎ fú zì ná dào le hǎo yùn qi dōu yòng wán le",
      "english": "The English media started to mock them upon seeing this photo, claiming the couple didn’t understand the characters."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": " \n    ",
      "traditional": " \n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Since they were holding the “happiness” character upside down, they had run out of luck."
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "中国网友们看到这条新闻都笑了，",
      "traditional": "中國網友們看到這條新聞都笑了，",
      "pinyin": "zhōng guó wǎng yǒu men kàn dào zhè tiáo xīn wén dōu xiào le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "他们说，英国媒体才是不懂中国文化的那个。",
      "traditional": "他們說，英國媒體才是不懂中國文化的那個。",
      "pinyin": "tā men shuō yīng guó méi tǐ cái shì bù dǒng zhōng guó wén huà de nà ge",
      "english": "Chinese netizens started to laugh when they saw this news."
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "在中国人们喜欢把“福”字倒着贴，",
      "traditional": "在中國人們喜歡把“福”字倒著貼，",
      "pinyin": "zài zhōng guó rén men xǐ huan bǎ fú zì dào zhe tiē",
      "english": "They said English media is the one who doesn't know about Chinese culture."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "因为“福倒”听起来跟“福到”一样，",
      "traditional": "因為“福倒”聽起來跟“福到”一樣，",
      "pinyin": "yīn wèi fú dào tīng qǐ lái gēn fú dào yí yàng",
      "english": "In China, people like to put up the “happiness” character upside down, .."
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "人们希望新的一年幸福会到来。",
      "traditional": "人們希望新的一年幸福會到來。",
